<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 10 bln SKR of 3-mo/12-mo T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 10 bln SKR of 3-mo/12-mo T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would auction five billion crowns worth of six-month Treasury bills and the same amount of one year T-bills.</p>
<p>Bids are due at 1030 GMT on July 9.</p>
<p>					  190-day bill	336-day bill</p>
<p> Maturity date			Jan 21 '98	  June 17 '98</p>
<p> Volume to market (Blns Skr)	 5.0		   5.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			    July 11, 1997</p>
<p> Auction date				 July 9, 1997</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
